{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人許志安上周舉行演唱會，據悉，多名市民購買假門票，直至上周六（8日）入場時遭拒，才發現受騙並報案處理。</p><p>警方今（12日）回覆本報查詢稱，接獲11人報案，涉款共約2.9萬元，案件列作「以欺騙手段取得財產」處理。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T11:39:06.905239+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T11:16:39+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T12:57:39.423073+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T11:37:47.103906+00:00","content_hash":"3905930368c2f48dc2b4e42baa217b93f45007d280b680b5b2a13dd23d576d10","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}